WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.560
I'm so sleepy.

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:05.810
Are you tired, Satsuki-chan?

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.940
I was on banquet duty until late last night.

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:12.980
There are tea and snacks 
in the attendant room.

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:15.450
You should take a break.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:17.070
Yeah, I will.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:24.450
Are these the snacks?

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:27.490
I wonder if they're European sweets.

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:33.850
The medicine man saved me 
with his drug to make me bigger!

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:34.920
Don't mention it.

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:41.260
We may go way back, but at a cat ceremony, 
I'd be the one to end up a feast.

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:45.960
I just need to take the shrinking 
medicine, and all's right again.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.270
The medicine is here in the—

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:22.030
<b>Konohana Kitan</b>

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:27.040
<b>Episode 10: 
The Sister Strikes</b>

00:02:27.190 --> 00:02:30.870
You ate the shrinking medicine, 
thinking it was a snack?

00:02:30.870 --> 00:02:32.430
What an idiot!

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:36.250
I'm sorry. I should have explained it to you.

00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:40.510
He doesn't have any extra medicine, 
so you're going to be that way for a while.

00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:42.640
Want to wrap her in this for now?

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:43.800
Hell no!

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:46.220
Satsuki-neesama, I finished sewing this.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:50.670
She's so cute!

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:53.350
I just wanted a normal kimono.

00:02:54.720 --> 00:02:57.720
<i>The cursed doll is staring 
at me with jealous eyes...</i>

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:01.320
<i>There only needs to be </i>one<i> doll.</i>

00:03:01.570 --> 00:03:03.580
What do we do now, though?

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:07.050
Work doesn't get done 
around here without you.

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:08.430
I can give out orders.

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:09.530
It's fine.

00:03:09.530 --> 00:03:10.960
Let's go, Yuzu.

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:11.740
Okay.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:13.710
First, clean the hallways.

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:14.250
Okay.

00:03:14.450 --> 00:03:16.150
Next, clean the detached rooms.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:16.830
Okay.

00:03:17.980 --> 00:03:19.280
Hey, Natsume!

00:03:19.280 --> 00:03:21.980
Don't walk there. You'll damage the moss!

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:25.830
Damn it, my voice is smaller, too.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:27.790
Yuzu, tell her for me.

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.140
Okay.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:32.530
P-Please don't walk there.

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:33.720
What?

00:03:33.720 --> 00:03:36.530
Satsuki's nitpicking again, isn't she?

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:37.850
How dare you, kid?!

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.810
Why would you say such a thing, child?

00:03:39.810 --> 00:03:41.600
Yuzu Translate.

00:03:42.210 --> 00:03:45.280
Damn it... Natsume pisses me off.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.090
Yuzu, our reservation is here.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.580
<b>Konohanatei</b>

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.190
Welcome.

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:56.410
Huh? Your voice is echoing.

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:57.990
Thank you for coming.

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:01.340
I got lost on my way here.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:02.960
We'll show you the way.

00:04:06.650 --> 00:04:10.470
Ma'am, may we prepare a footbath for you?

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:14.540
That feels great.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.520
It relieves the exhaustion 
of such a long trip.

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:21.350
Have the leaves turned colors 
on the mountain paths yet?

00:04:21.350 --> 00:04:22.690
<i>The mountain paths?</i>

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:24.580
Yes.

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:28.170
Spectacularly.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:31.020
I was entranced by the scenery.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:33.830
But...

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:39.000
The scenery in this garden is lovely, too.

00:04:54.380 --> 00:04:59.900
Did you bring the guest through that area 
because you knew the scenery there is pretty?

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:00.810
Yes.

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:04.420
I thought I'd have her relax in a 
footbath as she enjoyed the garden.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:06.600
She seemed tired from 
walking the mountain path.

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:07.530
That's the thing.

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.860
How did you know she 
came from the mountains?

00:05:12.390 --> 00:05:16.510
She had a cane, and her feet were dirty.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:22.930
Also, I came to Konohanatei 
by the mountain path, too.

00:05:22.930 --> 00:05:24.860
So I could kind of tell.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.770
Satsuki-chan, what's your next order?

00:05:52.440 --> 00:05:55.740
Nah, I don't have anything more.

00:05:58.360 --> 00:06:01.880
<i>She has really become a model attendant.</i>

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:08.040
<i>But she's still just as much of a klutz.</i>

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:14.430
You know, though, even with Satsuki 
being small, we can still get our work done,

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:16.140
and she's not as annoying as usual.

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.250
What?!

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.230
Maybe she should just stay this way.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:21.180
She can't!

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:23.500
She has to go back to her normal self!

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:25.900
No, I was kidding.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.210
Sorry.

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:28.550
<i>Yuzu...</i>

00:06:29.800 --> 00:06:33.220
Jeez, Natsume's taking too 
much pleasure in my misery.

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:34.530
Sorry.

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:38.240
This was my fault in the first place.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:40.580
No, I should have been more careful.

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:41.950
It's not your fault...

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:54.720
You're cute when you're small, 
but I miss the normal you.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:07:01.610
I'll do anything if it'll make you normal again.

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.230
<i>Yuzu...</i>

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:09.730
You're my admired senpai.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.250
<i>She's right.</i>

00:07:21.820 --> 00:07:26.940
<i>I got to see her from 
a different angle today...</i>

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:35.070
Satsuki-chan.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:39.340
<i>But that scenery was definitely the best.</i>

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.440
Satsuki-chan!

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:57.290
Thank goodness!

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.940
You're back to normal!

00:07:58.940 --> 00:08:00.500
Thank goodness!

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:02.200
Well, jeez.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:04.180
That was anticlimactic.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:07.580
The medicine man 
delivered it to us overnight.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:09.760
I imagine it's troubling her.

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:12.260
Let's give it to her while she's asleep.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:17.580
We caused the medicine man trouble, 
and I ended up sleep-deprived...

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:18.680
What a mess.

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.300
Thank goodness.

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:22.810
But how did I suddenly get back to normal?

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:23.800
Huh?

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.510
Come to think of it, have you 
ever heard about this?

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:31.490
In the west, they say that a lover's kiss is

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:34.490
the best way to undo 
a magic transformation.

00:08:34.800 --> 00:08:39.530
Maybe a princess saved you 
while you were asleep.

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:41.210
Just kidding.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:47.580
I'll do anything if it'll make you normal again.

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:57.150
Satsuki-chan, where are you going?

00:08:57.580 --> 00:08:59.330
Satsuki-chan!

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:00.890
<i>Is that really it?</i>

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:02.310
<i>But... no way.</i>

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:04.100
<i>But I can't ask!</i>

00:09:04.100 --> 00:09:06.740
Satsuki-chan!

00:09:12.900 --> 00:09:17.160
We haven't seen your sister since 
the Great Cherry Blossom Banquet.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:19.710
She didn't even bother to stick around.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.030
Well, then...

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.010
Hey-ho!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.240
Hiiragi-neesama, you say that 
like you're challenging them.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.830
Is it true that Hiiragi-san is here?

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:31.170
Y-Yes.

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.230
Why are you so excited?

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:37.310
Well, Satsuki-neesama and Hiiragi-san 
are blood sisters, right?

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:40.700
And Satsuki-neesama is trying 
to become a priestess.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:43.470
Yet, Hiiragi-san became a priestess,

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.440
while Satsuki-neesama had to become 
an attendant at Konohanatei.

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:51.240
I bet there's some sibling drama.

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:53.920
Do you know anything about it, Yuzu-chan?

00:09:53.920 --> 00:09:55.320
Uh, no...

00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:58.240
Here comes the priestess's party.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:03.420
Hey, you.

00:10:03.420 --> 00:10:04.740
Y-Yes?

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:07.020
You're cute.

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:08.500
Come to my room later.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.270
Just ignore her.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:13.200
This is the nature of her illness.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.000
What was that for, Ayame?!

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.920
Where do you even hide 
that thing all the time?

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.920
I'm sorry for the disrespect.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:20.420
Th-They're pretty unusual.

00:10:22.130 --> 00:10:24.570
Who's going to be in charge of their room?

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:27.260
Well, knowing Kiri-san...

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:30.220
Satsuki will be in charge 
of the priestess's room.

00:10:30.770 --> 00:10:33.230
You won't tell me you can't, will you?

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:35.480
That would be unprofessional of you.

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.500
Damn that tanuki!

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:41.930
U-Um, I'll do my best, too.

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:43.530
So don't push yourself too much.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:46.120
In what way would I be pushing myself?

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.620
N-Nothing.

00:10:48.790 --> 00:10:52.440
I came to Konohanatei in place of my sister.

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:55.890
I wasn't the one chosen to be a priestess.

00:10:56.720 --> 00:11:00.240
I bet there's some sibling drama.

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:07.150
Satsuki, I brought our 
mother's famous nukazuke.

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:08.140
Nukazuke!

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:11.660
You've always liked old fogey food, 
ever since you were little.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:14.280
And you'd drink too much 
water and wet the bed.

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:15.100
Onee-chan!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.620
Thank you for coming to Konohanatei.

00:11:20.620 --> 00:11:22.640
I'm attendant Satsuki.

00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:25.070
Next to me is Yuzu, also an attendant.

00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:29.160
You were both beautiful at the 
Great Cherry Blossom Banquet.

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:31.140
This shrimp was at the banquet?

00:11:31.140 --> 00:11:33.880
She was there, next to Satsuki-san.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.250
Konohanatei attendants are stars.

00:11:37.250 --> 00:11:40.080
Can a dull girl like you really make it?

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:41.860
Um...

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:46.050
With all due respect, it doesn't 
matter how attractive she appears.

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:53.260
Yuzu here may lack experience, but she 
will no doubt work to your satisfaction.

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:54.760
Satsuki-chan...

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:57.320
Bath time.

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:59.010
Come, Ayame.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:00.780
I shall accompany you.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:05.080
Hey, Satsuki-chan... um, thank—

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:09.250
If you screw this up, 
my reputation will be ruined.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:10.970
Keep that firmly in mind.

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:11.440
Okay!

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.100
It's an outdoor bath!

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:18.970
No jumping in, please.

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:28.460
What are you, a kid?

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:30.310
You're all wet now.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.720
Might as well join me.

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.680
I can't take a bath with a guest.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:34.560
Why?

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:37.750
You used to cry and beg 
to take a bath with me.

00:12:37.750 --> 00:12:39.840
Stop talking about the past!

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:41.830
Yuzu-san.

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:43.030
Yes?

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.100
Would you mind washing my back?

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:50.970
Man, you're as fun as ever.

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:57.500
Did Satsuki-san tell you that she was sent 
to serve in place of Hiiragi-neesama?

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.970
No, well...

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:05.870
The truth is, Hiiragi-neesama can't wait 
for Satsuki-san to become a priestess.

00:13:07.230 --> 00:13:10.890
Hiiragi-neesama is 
Ubusugami-sama's favorite.

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:15.590
One word from the shrine, and Konohanatei 
would have no say in the matter.

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:25.530
Please don't hate us if we end up 
taking your precious Satsuki-san.

00:13:31.420 --> 00:13:34.680
Once I'm free to resign, I'm going 
to aim to become a priestess again.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:38.530
<i>Satsuki-chan's dream 
is to become a priestess.</i>

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:43.280
<i>I should be happy for that to come true.</i>

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:47.940
<i>I'm so selfish.</i>

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:53.470
Hiiragi-sama!

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:55.240
Hiiragi-neesama!

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:56.700
What's the matter?

00:13:56.700 --> 00:13:59.430
My sister's been missing all day.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:03.480
She's always been a troublemaker, but this is—

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.310
What the hell are you doing, ma'am?!

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:11.570
Are you trying to be polite, Satsuki?

00:14:11.570 --> 00:14:13.710
What am I doing? I'm helping someone.

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:17.540
This princess here was having 
trouble getting down.

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:18.910
Princess!

00:14:18.910 --> 00:14:20.750
Thank goodness you're safe!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:22.520
Thank you!

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:24.710
Ma'am, are you all right?

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:26.080
Now, come this way.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.930
No! I'm staying with Onee-chan!

00:14:28.150 --> 00:14:29.130
Oh, dear.

00:14:29.130 --> 00:14:31.090
You're as popular as always.

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:33.130
Though she's a bit too young for me.

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:36.310
All right, let's have some fun!

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.070
She's weird, isn't she?

00:14:41.020 --> 00:14:43.780
She always finds her way 
to the center of everyone.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:47.260
She's freewheeling and wild.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:48.820
She draws people to her.

00:14:49.400 --> 00:14:52.140
She's insufferable.

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:56.300
You're proud of your sister, huh?

00:14:58.770 --> 00:14:59.870
Maybe.

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:06.580
<i>Satsuki-chan admires Hiiragi-san.</i>

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:11.600
<i>And Hiiragi-san wants Satsuki-chan 
to become a priestess, too.</i>

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:17.050
What brings you here to Konohanatei, though?

00:15:18.040 --> 00:15:25.210
<i>Being near Hiiragi-san must make 
Satsuki-chan happier than anything.</i>

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.450
What's the matter, ma'am?

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:32.750
The princess wishes to see the kagura dance.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:36.170
But we must return to the moon tonight.

00:15:36.170 --> 00:15:39.490
Are the moon dancers 
not to your liking, Princess?

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:43.200
No! I'm bored of the bunny dancers!

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:43.830
Huh? That sounds cute.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.480
Is something wrong?

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:46.540
Well...

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:49.460
Oh, that's it?

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:50.710
I can handle this.

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:53.730
Ayame, you brought your chihaya, right?

00:15:53.730 --> 00:15:54.350
Yes.

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:58.850
But it seems I stayed in the bath too long.

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:00.650
I can't stand up straight.

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:01.280
Are you all right?

00:16:01.530 --> 00:16:02.740
I know.

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:06.440
Satsuki-san, would you dance in my place?

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.150
What?!

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:11.110
Yeah, I'm sure you can do it, Satsuki.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:15.920
You used to imitate the priestesses' 
dances when you were a kid.

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:18.660
That was just a kid's game.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:20.040
You can do it.

00:16:20.310 --> 00:16:22.020
You have talent.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.930
Besides, you have the great 
Hiiragi-sama with you.

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.250
Just do as I do.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:31.960
But I'm not a priestess.

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:34.930
Satsuki-chan, a guest is making a request.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:39.390
You're the only one here who 
can dance with Hiiragi-san.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:43.250
Please, as an attendant, 
dance for our guest.

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:20.020
A kagura dance is a sign of gratitude 
to a god, as well as a prayer.

00:17:21.120 --> 00:17:24.190
There's no such thing 
as skill in being grateful.

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:29.490
It's the same thing as what 
you've been doing at Konohanatei.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:33.200
So I know you can do it.

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.380
That was impressive, you two.

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:04.050
Of course.

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:05.800
Right, Satsuk—

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:10.940
Satsuki?

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:19.610
Satsuki-chan!

00:18:22.520 --> 00:18:24.530
Satsuki-chan, why—

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:36.360
Um, S-Satsuki-chan, that was beautiful.

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:37.940
You were like a real priestess.

00:18:37.940 --> 00:18:39.160
I'm a fake.

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:43.200
It's even more obvious 
with a real one next to me.

00:18:43.470 --> 00:18:47.130
I only managed to do the dance 
because of my sister's talent.

00:18:47.320 --> 00:18:49.350
So I know you can do it.

00:18:50.680 --> 00:18:51.770
Damn it.

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:55.320
I'm no match for her.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:58.270
It's always been that way.

00:18:58.620 --> 00:19:04.110
No matter what I do, no matter how much 
I put my mind to it, I'm only ever faking it.

00:19:04.630 --> 00:19:07.760
My sister always outdid me with raw talent.

00:19:07.760 --> 00:19:11.860
The older sister's a genius, but the younger 
one's a jack of all trades, master of none.

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:18.960
I never had a comeback 
when people would say that.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:25.430
Why are you crying, Yuzu?

00:19:27.640 --> 00:19:31.900
<i>Satsuki-chan worked hard all this time,</i>

00:19:32.440 --> 00:19:36.860
<i>always being compared to 
such greatness and talent.</i>

00:19:37.370 --> 00:19:40.520
<i>It must have been so painful.</i>

00:19:41.590 --> 00:19:42.570
I'm sorry.

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:46.310
It's because I asked you to dance

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:48.630
without thinking about how you'd feel.

00:19:49.670 --> 00:19:51.330
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:55.300
I just did my job, of my own will.

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:59.510
For the guest, as an attendant.

00:20:00.810 --> 00:20:02.780
That's what you said.

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:15.110
If the guest is happy, so am I.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.320
Hey, Satsuki-chan...

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.870
You're even prettier with your makeup.

00:20:31.750 --> 00:20:33.500
Cut it out, idiot.

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.250
We'll be back for a more 
relaxing bath next time.

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:44.630
Thank you for your hospitality.

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:47.140
Goodbye.

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:50.510
Why was she even here, anyway?

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:51.800
Who knows?

00:20:53.340 --> 00:20:55.800
You lied about being in the bath too long.

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:57.780
You were testing Satsuki, weren't you?

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:01.820
Satsuki-san is a quick learner.

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:05.250
I'd expect no less from your sister.

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:07.570
She's never even trained in dancing.

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:10.070
I gave her some tips, 
and she had it figured out.

00:21:10.070 --> 00:21:11.630
What a headache.

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:14.710
We'll send Hiiragi to serve at Konohanatei.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:18.710
But dear, that girl doesn't 
even know her times tables.

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:24.470
She's good at dancing and singing, so 
everyone expects her to become a priestess.

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:27.970
Mother wanted Satsuki 
to come to Konohanatei

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:31.130
because she's smart and stays out of trouble.

00:21:31.130 --> 00:21:34.190
You <i>still</i> don't know your times tables.

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:39.560
She's doing great as an attendant,
the job I wasn't chosen for.

00:21:40.130 --> 00:21:42.310
And it looks like she has some good friends.

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:45.070
I was going to invite her to the shrine

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:48.410
if she didn't have any friends 
because of her jaded personality.

00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:52.360
Aren't you going to tell 
Satsuki-san what you said?

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:55.300
What?

00:21:55.300 --> 00:21:58.620
Why would I tell her 
about how I lost to her?

00:21:58.620 --> 00:21:59.580
No way in hell.

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:00.650
Fine, fine.

00:23:35.060 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>Next Episode: 
A God's Day Off</b>
